# Jupyter Kernel - Session state (superseded by K2)
#
# The accumulation/rollback/delta session logic that used to live here moved
# to src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/notebook/local_exec.spl (LocalExec, implementing
# the NotebookExecutor trait from K1 — see
# doc/03_plan/agent_tasks/notebook_lanes_parallel_plan_2026-08-07.md Stream K,
# task K2). src/app/jupyter_kernel/main.spl now drives that logic through
# std.notebook.session_manager.KernelSessionManager instead of the
# module-level functions this file used to define.
#
# Kept as a file (not deleted) because
# test/03_system/tools/jupyter/jupyter_kernel_install_system_spec.spl checks
# for its existence as part of the historical kernel module layout; it no
# longer defines any symbols and nothing imports it.
